  (text "2068 bus interface. Nets: n = active low, _L = 3.3 V copy of a bus signal, BAn = buffered address, SDn = SRAM-side data." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 285 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "84eda3ba-7d48-4d96-939f-19aba25f0fb5"))
  (text "Power: edge +5V (B4) goes to the power sheet as +5V_EDGE. +15V (B3) unused. LVC inputs take the 2068's 5 V; a 3.3 V high is a TTL high." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 290 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4a8447b8-b39c-40a4-8b6d-9f20d96a16ca"))
